    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d7f002f6f55922a734da9047",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "对手是同期的超级溪流与小栗帽。\n她打从心底期待能三人一起跑出\n超盛大祭典的那一天。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c056815a6253c161faa504a6815e43516c47db252db6b765868cfa3521984b6c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
