      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "同班同学误会稻荷一是因为\n实力远超地方等级才转进学园，\n令她内心愤慨不已。",
      "source_fingerprint": "836d9d48321f5f51eeb99d5e9df4aefcd489477866708cd5c9b672df21600c1a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
