    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c0adacd49ec3c0c72d6e6968",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "无论如何都不想听到别人说\n地方的赛马娘不如中央，但凭现在的自己，\n根本没人会在乎自己的意见吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8ad41a8d5e893b7ca819cac256cae3446d4844f761fdb36a103c292593bebcfe",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
