      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "因此她决心成为竞赛界的重要存在，\n令所有人都无法忽视自己的话语，\n并对世人宣告地方不输中央。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f17f4b4b2eee9d946808a940780ce20aed977e625398994eda2f742bca37a199",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
