      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "稻荷一为了达成新的目标，\n开始进行新马级的武者修行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "523ef3f9f524a7055a0a7fa323991f64ebdefd8b0131ceb65ecdde2105494b26",
