      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "稻荷一在电视采访中\n宣布“下个目标是日本沙土德比”。\n播出时却获得“令人意外”的评论。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fdc8c8f186abb7bf90b6c6393f134930a1b198352943f089c62bc67ddcd38f75",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
