      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "记者们甚至还跑去大井，\n采访稻荷一转进学园前指导过她的师傅──",
      "source_fingerprint": "c9fb49f555d257505b33cd90efb0519435267541645d469c5e04542509acf116",
